# Ka-Zar of the Savage Land: "You may look at the top card of your library any time. You may play lands from the top of your library. When
# Ka-Zar enters, create Zabu, a legendary 2/2 green Cat creature token with 'Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, put a +1/+1
# counter on Zabu.'" Turn 1: Ka-Zar enters and makes Zabu; the Forest on top of the library is played from there (Zabu 3/3), and that was
# Bot1's land play for the turn, so the Forest in hand is refused. Turn 3: the top card is a Grizzly Bears, which can't be played from the
# top of the library (only lands); a Forest from hand is, and Zabu is 4/4.

